  "aiContextParagraph": "The APEC summit in Shenzhen has served as a focal point for significant international diplomacy, including a notable one-on-one session between President Prabowo Subianto and President Vladimir Putin. Government officials have highlighted the importance of these engagements for Indonesia's strategic interests and energy diplomacy. Simultaneously, the summit facilitated a high-profile meeting between Donald Trump, Xi Jinping, and Vladimir Putin, which culminated in a four-point peace declaration. While this gathering has drawn international attention, NATO Secretary-General Mark Rutte has publicly stated he is not concerned that these discussions will precipitate a geopolitical scenario resembling 'Yalta 2.0'. The summit also featured displays of new technology, including humanoid robots, reflecting the gathering's emphasis on global innovation alongside its traditional focus on economic and diplomatic policy discussions.",
